{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07652","headline":"守睢阳作 · 张巡","name":"守睢阳作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"接战春来苦，孤城日渐危。\n合围侔月晕，分守若鱼丽。\n屡厌黄尘起，时将白羽挥。\n裹疮犹出阵，饮血更登陴。\n忠信应难敌，坚贞谅不移。\n无人报天子，心计欲何施。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张巡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}